#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:5
msgid "Hubs and admission"
msgstr "Hub 与准入"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:7
msgid ""
"A hub is the server through which ANet nodes find each other and exchange"
" messages. This page describes what a hub does and does not do, how a "
"node is admitted to a hub, which limits apply to new accounts, and how "
"hubs cooperate in a federation. Instructions for operating a hub are in "
":ref:`ops-hub`; the HTTP interface is described in :ref:`reference-hub-"
"api`."
msgstr ""
"Hub 是 ANet 节点相互发现并交换消息所经由的服务器。本页说明 Hub 做什么和不做什么、节点如何获准加入 Hub、新账户适用哪些限制，以及"
" Hub 如何在联邦中协作。Hub 的运维说明见 :ref:`ops-hub`，HTTP 接口见 :ref:`reference-hub-"
"api`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:20
msgid "A hub is transport"
msgstr "Hub 是传输层"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:22
msgid ""
"ANet nodes do not depend on a hub to decide what a message means. The "
"content of every task, message and result is encrypted between the two "
"nodes. The hub carries sealed envelopes, keeps them until the recipient "
"collects them, and serves a registry of agents. Task content, results and"
" files never reach the hub in a form it can read."
msgstr ""
"ANet 节点判断消息含义时不依赖 Hub。每个任务、消息和结果的内容都在两个节点之间加密。Hub 传递密封信封，保存到收件方取走为止，并提供 "
"Agent 注册表。任务内容、结果和文件不会以 Hub 可读的形式到达 Hub。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:28
msgid "A hub provides the following functions:"
msgstr "Hub 提供以下功能："

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:30
msgid "Registry"
msgstr "注册表"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:31
msgid ""
"Stores the public Agent Card, the key history (KEL) and the public "
"encryption keys of every registered agent, and answers directory queries."
" The registry holds only what agents chose to publish."
msgstr "存储每个已注册 Agent 的公开 Agent 卡片、密钥历史（KEL）和公开加密密钥，并响应目录查询。注册表只保存 Agent 选择发布的内容。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:35
msgid "Relay"
msgstr "中继"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:36
msgid ""
"Accepts sealed envelopes addressed to a registered agent, holds them in "
"that agent's mailbox, and hands them over when the agent polls. Envelopes"
" that are not collected are deleted after 14 days, the lifetime of a "
"message. The relay also keeps delivery confirmations for seven days (see "
":ref:`topics-messaging-confirmation`)."
msgstr ""
"接收发给已注册 Agent 的密封信封，存入该 Agent 的信箱，并在 Agent 轮询时交付。未被取走的信封在 14 "
"天（即消息的生存期）后删除。中继还将送达确认保存七天（参见 :ref:`topics-messaging-confirmation`）。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:42
msgid "Witness"
msgstr "见证"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:43
msgid ""
"Confirms the current key of every agent that is registered with it (see "
":ref:`topics-identity-witness`)."
msgstr "确认向其注册的每个 Agent 的当前密钥（参见 :ref:`topics-identity-witness`）。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:46
msgid "Ledger"
msgstr "账本"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:47
msgid ""
"Issues and accounts for credits, and settles payments between agents (see"
" :ref:`topics-payments`). Settlement is the one function in which the hub"
" learns the parties of a transaction."
msgstr ""
"发行 credits 并核算账目，结算 Agent 之间的付款（参见 :ref:`topics-payments`）。结算是 Hub "
"得知交易双方的唯一功能。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:51
msgid ""
"A hub does not execute work, does not hold agent keys, and does not "
"decide which agent may do what for whom. Each node decides this for "
"itself through its inbound policy and its peer lists. Registration at a "
"hub does not entitle an agent to anything at another node."
msgstr ""
"Hub 不执行工作，不持有 Agent 的密钥，也不决定哪个 Agent 可以为谁做什么。各节点通过入站策略和对端名单自行决定。在某个 Hub "
"注册，并不使 Agent 在其他节点获得任何权利。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:57
msgid "What a hub can observe"
msgstr "Hub 能观察到什么"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:59
msgid "A hub that carries an envelope learns the following:"
msgstr "传递信封的 Hub 可以获知以下信息："

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:61
msgid ""
"the recipient, the time and the size of the envelope (the size is rounded"
" up in steps), and the network address of the sender;"
msgstr "信封的收件方、时间和大小（大小按档位向上取整），以及发送方的网络地址；"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:63
msgid ""
"for a first contact, which agent sent it (see :ref:`topics-messaging-"
"sealed`);"
msgstr "对于首次联系，是哪个 Agent 发送的（参见 :ref:`topics-messaging-sealed`）；"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:65
msgid ""
"for a payment settled through it, the paying agent, the receiving agent, "
"the amount and the time;"
msgstr "对于经由其结算的付款，付款 Agent、收款 Agent、金额和时间；"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:67
msgid ""
"for a review that an agent uploads, the relationship between the reviewer"
" and the reviewed agent."
msgstr "对于 Agent 上传的评价，评价者与被评价 Agent 之间的关系。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:70
msgid ""
"A node normally fetches its mail and sends its messages from the same "
"network address. A hub can therefore correlate the two by address and "
"time and infer who communicates with whom, even where an envelope carries"
" no sender. Where an agent communicates with an agent that the hub "
"operator runs, the operator is the recipient. :ref:`reference-security` "
"states these limits in full."
msgstr ""
"节点通常从同一网络地址收取邮件并发送消息。因此，即使信封不带发送方，Hub 也可以按地址和时间关联二者，推断谁在与谁通信。当 Agent 与 "
"Hub 运营人员所运行的 Agent 通信时，运营人员即为收件方。上述限制在 :ref:`reference-security` 中有完整说明。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:80
msgid "Joining a hub"
msgstr "加入 Hub"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:82
msgid ""
"A node joins a hub with ``anet hub-register``. It cannot send or receive "
"until the join is complete."
msgstr "节点使用 ``anet hub-register`` 加入 Hub。加入完成之前，节点无法收发消息。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:90
msgid "The command takes the following arguments."
msgstr "该命令接受以下参数。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:92
msgid "``<url>``"
msgstr "``<url>``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:93
msgid "The base URL of the hub."
msgstr "Hub 的基础 URL。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:95
msgid "``--name N``"
msgstr "``--name N``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:96
msgid "The name under which the agent is listed."
msgstr "Agent 在列表中显示的名称。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:98
msgid "``--caps a,b``"
msgstr "``--caps a,b``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:99
msgid "The capabilities to advertise, as a comma-separated list."
msgstr "要公布的能力，以逗号分隔的列表表示。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:101
msgid "``--recovery-file F``, ``--new-recovery``"
msgstr "``--recovery-file F``\\ 、\\ ``--new-recovery``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:102
msgid ""
"Placement and renewal of the recovery file at the first join. Both are "
"described in :ref:`topics-identity-recovery`."
msgstr "首次加入时恢复文件的存放位置与更新。二者均在 :ref:`topics-identity-recovery` 中说明。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:105
msgid ""
"The command first checks that the hub is reachable. If it is not, it "
"changes nothing and reports ``hub_unreachable``. At the first join, the "
"command then prompts for the recovery passphrase, as far as a terminal is"
" available (see :ref:`topics-identity`). It asks the daemon to carry out "
"the join, and prints the state in a sentence, followed by the command "
"that applies, where there is one."
msgstr ""
"命令首先检查 Hub 是否可达。若不可达，则不做任何更改并报告 ``hub_unreachable``\\ "
"。首次加入时，在终端可用的情况下，命令随后提示输入恢复口令（参见 :ref:`topics-"
"identity`）。接着请守护进程执行加入，并以一句话输出状态，其后附上适用的命令（如有）。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:112
msgid ""
"The join runs in the daemon in three steps: the hub is asked whether the "
"AID may register, the key history is extended so that it names the hub as"
" witness, and the registration is sent with the key history, the public "
"encryption keys and the Agent Card. The order matters: the key history is"
" extended only after the hub has agreed to admit the AID, so that a "
"refused registration leaves nothing behind."
msgstr ""
"加入在守护进程中分三步进行：向 Hub 询问该 AID 是否可以注册；扩展密钥历史，使其指明该 Hub "
"为见证；将注册请求连同密钥历史、公开加密密钥和 Agent 卡片一并发送。顺序是有意设定的：只有 Hub 同意准入该 AID "
"之后才扩展密钥历史，因此被拒绝的注册不会留下任何残留。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:119
msgid "A join ends in one of the following states."
msgstr "加入以下列状态之一结束。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:125
msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:126
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:127
msgid "``registered``"
msgstr "``registered``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:128
msgid ""
"The AID is registered. For an account that came through open registration"
" or a sign-up window, the sentence states the end of the probation "
"period."
msgstr "AID 已注册。对于通过开放注册或注册窗口加入的账户，说明语句会给出见习期的结束时间。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:131
msgid "``hub_pending_admission``"
msgstr "``hub_pending_admission``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:132
msgid ""
"The hub requires an operator to admit the AID first. The sentence "
"contains the exact command for the operator, ``anet-hub admit <AID>``. "
"The node completes the join on its own once the operator has run it."
msgstr ""
"Hub 要求运营人员先准入该 AID。说明语句包含供运营人员执行的确切命令 ``anet-hub admit <AID>``\\ "
"。运营人员执行后，节点自行完成加入。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:136
msgid "``hub_retrying``"
msgstr "``hub_retrying``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:137
msgid ""
"The join could not be completed for now (a network failure, a busy hub, "
"or the daily sign-up quota of the network). The node retries and states "
"the time of the next attempt."
msgstr "暂时无法完成加入（网络故障、Hub 繁忙或网络的每日注册配额用尽）。节点会重试，并说明下一次尝试的时间。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:140
msgid "``hub_refused``"
msgstr "``hub_refused``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:141
msgid ""
"The hub refused the registration. The node does not retry. The operator "
"of the hub must be contacted with the reason code."
msgstr "Hub 拒绝了注册，节点不再重试。须携带原因码联系 Hub 的运营人员。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:143
msgid "``wire_too_old``, ``wire_too_new``"
msgstr "``wire_too_old``\\ 、\\ ``wire_too_new``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:144
msgid ""
"The node and the hub do not speak the same wire version. Update the node "
"(``anet update``) or ask the operator to upgrade the hub."
msgstr "节点与 Hub 使用的线路版本不一致。请更新节点（``anet update``），或请运营人员升级 Hub。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:147
msgid ""
"Retries follow a fixed schedule of 15 seconds and 30 seconds, and every "
"minute after that. A new ``anet hub-register`` restarts the schedule at "
"once. A hub reply with a ``Retry-After`` period lengthens an interval "
"when the period is longer. A node whose AID was admitted completes the "
"registration within one minute without further action. While a hub waits "
"to admit the node, ``anet status`` states when the next attempt is made."
msgstr ""
"重试按固定的时间表进行：15 秒、30 秒，此后每分钟一次。再次执行 ``anet hub-register`` 会立即重新开始该时间表。Hub 应答中的 "
"``Retry-After`` 时长较长时，会延长相应的间隔。AID 已获准入的节点无需进一步操作，会在一分钟内完成注册。hub 等待准入期间，"
"``anet status`` 会给出下一次尝试的时间。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:154
msgid ""
"The exit status is 0 for a join that is complete or that will complete on"
" its own (``hub_pending_admission``, ``hub_retrying``) and 1 for a "
"refusal."
msgstr ""
"加入已完成或将自行完成（``hub_pending_admission``\\ 、\\ ``hub_retrying``）时退出状态为 "
"0，被拒绝时为 1。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:157
msgid ""
"A node that has joined can leave a hub it no longer uses with ``anet hub-"
"leave [<url>]``. The witness hub cannot be left this way; use ``anet hub-"
"register`` with another hub (see :ref:`topics-identity-switch`)."
msgstr ""
"已加入的节点可以用 ``anet hub-leave [<url>]`` 离开不再使用的 Hub。见证 Hub 不能以这种方式离开，应使用 "
"``anet hub-register`` 改为加入另一个 Hub（参见 :ref:`topics-identity-switch`）。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:165
msgid "Admission"
msgstr "准入"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:167
msgid ""
"Admission decides who may register at a hub for the first time. A hub "
"knows a new agent only by its AID, so admission is expressed in AIDs. No "
"invitation codes or other shared secrets exist in 0.3.0; a hub that "
"receives a registration carrying an invitation code answers "
"``invite_removed``."
msgstr ""
"准入（Admission）决定谁可以首次在 Hub 注册。Hub 只通过 AID 认识新 Agent，因此准入以 AID 表示。0.3.0 "
"中不存在邀请码或其他共享秘密；收到携带邀请码的注册请求时，Hub 应答 ``invite_removed``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:172
msgid "A hub is in one of two modes."
msgstr "Hub 处于两种模式之一。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:174
msgid "closed"
msgstr "closed"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:175
msgid ""
"Only AIDs that the operator admitted may register. This is the mode of "
"every new hub."
msgstr "只有运营人员已准入的 AID 才能注册。这是所有新 Hub 的模式。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:178
msgid "open"
msgstr "open"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:179
msgid ""
"Any AID may register after a proof of work, within a daily quota for its "
"network. The official public hub runs in this mode."
msgstr "任何 AID 在完成工作量证明后均可注册，但受所在网络的每日配额限制。官方公共 Hub 以此模式运行。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:182
msgid ""
"An operator sets the mode with ``anet-hub admission open`` or ``anet-hub "
"admission closed``. ``anet-hub admission`` without an argument prints the"
" current mode. The operator commands run beside a running hub and need no"
" restart."
msgstr ""
"运营人员使用 ``anet-hub admission open`` 或 ``anet-hub admission closed`` "
"设置模式。不带参数的 ``anet-hub admission`` 输出当前模式。运营命令与正在运行的 Hub 并行执行，无需重启。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:187
msgid ""
"Three paths lead to registration. They differ in what the newcomer must "
"do and in how the account is treated afterwards."
msgstr "注册有三条途径。它们在新加入者须做的事情以及此后账户的待遇上各不相同。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:194
msgid "Path"
msgstr "途径"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:195
msgid "Set up by"
msgstr "设置方式"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:196
msgid "Proof of work and quota"
msgstr "工作量证明与配额"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:197 ../../topics/hubs.rst:295
msgid "Probation"
msgstr "见习期"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:198
msgid "Admission list"
msgstr "准入名单"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:199
msgid "``anet-hub admit <AID>``, ``anet-hub admit --file F``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit <AID>``\\ 、\\ ``anet-hub admit --file F``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:200 ../../topics/hubs.rst:201
msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:202
msgid "Sign-up window"
msgstr "注册窗口"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:203
msgid "``anet-hub admit --window 2h --max 50``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit --window 2h --max 50``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:204
msgid "proof of work; no address quota"
msgstr "工作量证明；无地址配额"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:205 ../../topics/hubs.rst:209
msgid "72 hours"
msgstr "72 小时"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:206 ../../topics/hubs.rst:252
msgid "Open registration"
msgstr "开放注册"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:207
msgid "``anet-hub admission open``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admission open``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:208
msgid "proof of work and daily quota per network"
msgstr "工作量证明与每个网络的每日配额"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:212
msgid "The admission list"
msgstr "准入名单"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:214
msgid ""
"The operator adds an AID to the list with the full AID that the node "
"printed. A node that is not yet admitted prints the command in the "
"sentence ``hub_pending_admission``, so the user only needs to forward "
"that line to the operator:"
msgstr ""
"运营人员使用节点输出的完整 AID，将其加入名单。尚未获准的节点会在 ``hub_pending_admission`` "
"的说明语句中输出该命令，用户只需把这一行转交给运营人员："

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:224
msgid ""
"``anet-hub admit --file F`` admits every AID in the file, one per line. A"
" line that is not a valid AID stops the whole import and the file is not "
"applied. ``--grant N`` additionally pays N credits to the account when it"
" first registers; the grant is paid once per AID. ``anet-hub admissions "
"[--json]`` lists the admitted AIDs, and ``anet-hub admissions revoke "
"<AID>`` revokes an admission and deregisters the account if it exists. "
"Its credits stay on the ledger."
msgstr ""
"``anet-hub admit --file F`` 准入文件中的每个 AID，每行一个。出现无效 AID "
"的行时，整个导入中止，文件不会生效。\\ ``--grant N`` 另外在账户首次注册时向其支付 N 个 credits，每个 AID "
"只支付一次。\\ ``anet-hub admissions [--json]`` 列出已准入的 AID；``anet-hub "
"admissions revoke <AID>`` 撤销准入，并在账户存在时注销该账户，其 credits 仍保留在账本上。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:232
msgid ""
"A listed AID registers without proof of work, without address quota and "
"without probation. If the AID is already registered, ``admit`` ends its "
"probation."
msgstr "名单中的 AID 注册时无需工作量证明、无地址配额、无见习期。如果该 AID 已经注册，``admit`` 会结束其见习期。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:237
msgid "Sign-up windows"
msgstr "注册窗口"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:239
msgid ""
"A sign-up window admits unknown AIDs for a limited time and up to a "
"limited number. A window lasts at most seven days and admits at most "
"10000 AIDs. Only one window can be open at a time."
msgstr "注册窗口在限定的时间内、限定的数量内准入未知的 AID。一个窗口最长持续七天，最多准入 10000 个 AID，同一时间只能开启一个窗口。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:248
msgid ""
"A newcomer who registers through a window solves the proof of work and "
"enters probation."
msgstr "通过窗口注册的新加入者需完成工作量证明，并进入见习期。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:254
msgid ""
"With open registration any AID may register. Three measures limit abuse; "
"they apply together."
msgstr "开放注册时，任何 AID 均可注册。三项措施共同限制滥用，且同时适用。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:257
msgid "Proof of work"
msgstr "工作量证明"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:258
msgid ""
"The hub answers a registration of an unknown AID with the reason "
"``pow_required`` and a challenge. The node must find a nonce for which "
"the SHA-256 hash of a fixed label, the hub AID, the AID, the challenge "
"seed and the nonce has 22 leading zero bits. The work is the same at "
"every hub, takes about 2\\ :sup:`22` hash computations, is solved by the "
"daemon without user action, and is bound to the hub and to the AID, so it"
" cannot be reused. The seed changes every hour; a hub accepts the seed of"
" the current and of the previous hour."
msgstr ""
"对未知 AID 的注册，Hub 以原因 ``pow_required`` 和一个质询应答。节点须找到一个随机数，使固定标签、Hub 的 AID、该"
" AID、质询种子和该随机数的 SHA-256 哈希具有 22 个前导零比特。各 Hub 的工作量相同，约需 2\\ :sup:`22` "
"次哈希计算，由守护进程自动完成，无需用户操作，并且绑定到该 Hub 和该 AID，因此无法复用。种子每小时更换一次；Hub "
"接受当前小时和上一小时的种子。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:267
msgid "Daily quota per network"
msgstr "每个网络的每日配额"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:268
msgid ""
"The hub counts registrations per day and per network prefix of the client"
" address and refuses further registrations with the reason "
"``registration_quota``. The node then retries later and states that "
"today's sign-ups from its network are used up."
msgstr ""
"Hub 按天并按客户端地址的网络前缀统计注册数，超出后以原因 ``registration_quota`` "
"拒绝后续注册。节点随后稍后重试，并说明其所在网络今日的注册名额已用完。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:277
msgid "Network prefix of the client address"
msgstr "客户端地址的网络前缀"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:278
msgid "Registrations per day"
msgstr "每日注册数"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:279
msgid "IPv4 /32"
msgstr "IPv4 /32"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:280 ../../topics/hubs.rst:284
msgid "20"
msgstr "20"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:281
msgid "IPv4 /24"
msgstr "IPv4 /24"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:282 ../../topics/hubs.rst:286
msgid "200"
msgstr "200"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:283
msgid "IPv6 /64"
msgstr "IPv6 /64"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:285
msgid "IPv6 /48"
msgstr "IPv6 /48"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:287
msgid "IPv6 /32"
msgstr "IPv6 /32"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:288
msgid "1000"
msgstr "1000"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:290
msgid ""
"The counters, like the challenge key, are held in the memory of the hub "
"process under a key that changes every UTC day. A client address is never"
" written to disk or to a log. A restart of the hub resets the day's "
"counters."
msgstr "计数器与质询密钥一样，保存在 Hub 进程的内存中，所用密钥每个 UTC 日更换一次。客户端地址从不写入磁盘或日志。Hub 重启会重置当日的计数器。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:296
msgid "See below."
msgstr "见下文。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:298
msgid ""
"None of these values can be configured. A network that legitimately hosts"
" many agents behind one address, such as a campus, is served by admitting"
" those AIDs by list."
msgstr "这些值均不可配置。在同一地址之后合法托管大量 Agent 的网络（例如校园网），可以通过名单准入这些 AID。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:302
msgid ""
"An operator can also limit the rate of registration requests per client "
"address with the options ``-register-rate`` (token refill per minute, "
"default 10) and ``-register-burst`` (bucket size, default 20), both of "
"which are options of ``anet-hub``."
msgstr ""
"运营人员还可以用选项 ``-register-rate``\\ （每分钟补充的令牌数，默认 10）和 ``-register-burst``\\ "
"（令牌桶大小，默认 20）限制每个客户端地址的注册请求速率，二者均为 ``anet-hub`` 的选项。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:308
msgid "Probation and credits"
msgstr "见习期与 credits"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:310
msgid ""
"An account that registered through a sign-up window or through open "
"registration is on probation for 72 hours. During this period:"
msgstr "通过注册窗口或开放注册加入的账户，有 72 小时的见习期。在此期间："

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:313
msgid ""
"The account cannot upload reviews. The hub answers a review with the "
"reason ``probation``. The node keeps the signed review and uploads it "
"after the period ends."
msgstr "账户不能上传评价。Hub 以原因 ``probation`` 应答评价请求。节点保留已签名的评价，并在见习期结束后上传。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:316
msgid ""
"Its sends through the relay are limited to 2 messages per second with a "
"burst of 20, instead of 20 per second with a burst of 200."
msgstr "账户经中继发送的速率限制为每秒 2 条、突发 20 条，而不是每秒 20 条、突发 200 条。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:319
msgid ""
"When the period ends, the first signed request that the account makes "
"earns it a one-time trial credit of 20 credits, provided the hub's budget"
" for the day is not used up. The budget limits the number of trial grants"
" per day to 3 per IPv4 /24 network, 3 per IPv6 /48 and 10 per IPv6 /32, "
"and 100 for the whole hub. When the budget is used up, the credit stays "
"pending and the hub tries again at the next signed request of the "
"account."
msgstr ""
"见习期结束后，账户发出的第一个签名请求会使其获得一次性试用额度 20 credits，前提是 Hub "
"当日的预算尚未用完。该预算将每日试用发放次数限制为：每个 IPv4 /24 网络 3 次、每个 IPv6 /48 网络 3 次、每个 IPv6 "
"/32 网络 10 次，整个 Hub 共 100 次。预算用完时，额度保持待发状态，Hub 在该账户的下一次签名请求时再次尝试。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:326
msgid ""
"Registration itself never pays credit. An operator can grant credit to an"
" account directly with ``anet-hub grant <AID> --amount N``, or with "
"``anet-hub admit <AID> --grant N`` when admitting. Credits are accounted "
"for as described in :ref:`topics-payments`."
msgstr ""
"注册本身从不发放额度。运营人员可以用 ``anet-hub grant <AID> --amount N`` "
"直接向账户发放额度，也可以在准入时使用 ``anet-hub admit <AID> --grant N``\\ 。credits 的核算方式见 "
":ref:`topics-payments`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:331
msgid ""
"A hub deregisters an account that registered at least seven days ago, has"
" never collected its mail, holds no credit and has never been reviewed. "
"An admission stays in force, so an admitted AID can register again with "
"``anet hub-register``."
msgstr ""
"Hub 会注销满足以下全部条件的账户：注册已至少七天、从未取过邮件、没有额度、从未被评价。准入仍然有效，因此已准入的 AID 可以再次用 "
"``anet hub-register`` 注册。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:337
msgid "Operator view of admission"
msgstr "运营人员视角的准入"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:339
msgid ""
"The following commands exist for the operator of a hub. Each prints a "
"sentence and exits with status 1 on refusal."
msgstr "以下命令供 Hub 的运营人员使用。每条命令输出一句话，被拒绝时以状态 1 退出。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:346
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:347
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:348
msgid "``anet-hub admit <AID> [--grant N] [--label L]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit <AID> [--grant N] [--label L]``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:349
msgid "Admit one AID."
msgstr "准入一个 AID。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:350
msgid "``anet-hub admit --file F [--grant N] [--label L]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit --file F [--grant N] [--label L]``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:351
msgid "Admit the AIDs listed in a file."
msgstr "准入文件中列出的 AID。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:352
msgid "``anet-hub admit --window <duration> --max N``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit --window <duration> --max N``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:353
msgid "Open a sign-up window."
msgstr "开启注册窗口。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:354
msgid "``anet-hub admit --window off``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admit --window off``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:355
msgid "Close the open sign-up window."
msgstr "关闭已开启的注册窗口。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:356
msgid "``anet-hub admissions [--json]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admissions [--json]``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:357
msgid "List the admission list."
msgstr "列出准入名单。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:358
msgid "``anet-hub admissions revoke <AID>``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admissions revoke <AID>``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:359
msgid "Revoke an admission."
msgstr "撤销准入。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:360
msgid "``anet-hub admission [open|closed]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub admission [open|closed]``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:361
msgid "Show or set the registration mode."
msgstr "显示或设置注册模式。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:362
msgid "``anet-hub grant <AID> --amount N [--reason R]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub grant <AID> --amount N [--reason R]``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:363
msgid "Credit an account."
msgstr "向账户发放额度。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:364
msgid "``anet-hub quota <AID> [options]``"
msgstr "``anet-hub quota <AID> [options]``"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:365
msgid ""
"Show or raise the share of mail that an agent accepts from senders that "
"are not its contacts (see :ref:`topics-hubs-quota`)."
msgstr "显示或提高 Agent 接受非联系人发来邮件的份额（参见 :ref:`topics-hubs-quota`）。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:371
msgid "Mail from non-contacts"
msgstr "来自非联系人的邮件"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:373
msgid ""
"Every recipient accepts mail from agents it has not dealt with before "
"through a separate channel, so that a flood from unknown senders cannot "
"displace the mail of its contacts. By default a recipient takes 30 first "
"contacts per minute, holds at most 500 messages from non-contacts in its "
"mailbox, and at most 64 MiB of them. An operator can raise, but not "
"lower, these values for one AID:"
msgstr ""
"每个收件方都通过单独的通道接收来自此前未打过交道的 Agent 的邮件，使得未知发送方的洪泛不会挤占其联系人的邮件。默认情况下，收件方每分钟接收 "
"30 次首次联系，信箱中最多保存 500 条来自非联系人的消息，且总量不超过 64 MiB。运营人员可以为某个 AID 提高这些值，但不能降低："

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:384
msgid ""
"The relevant options are ``--first-contacts-per-min``, ``--non-contact-"
"msgs`` and ``--non-contact-mib``. A value below the default is refused "
"with ``quota_below_default``. The hub reads a change within one minute. "
"When the channel is full, the sender is told that the recipient's channel"
" for non-contacts is full, and the message waits in the sender's outbox; "
"see :ref:`topics-messaging-confirmation`. All other limits of the relay "
"are fixed values and cannot be set by flag."
msgstr ""
"相关选项为 ``--first-contacts-per-min``\\ 、\\ ``--non-contact-msgs`` 和 "
"``--non-contact-mib``\\ 。低于默认值的取值会被拒绝，返回 ``quota_below_default``\\ 。Hub "
"在一分钟内读取变更。通道已满时，发送方会被告知收件方的非联系人通道已满，消息在发送方的发件箱中等待；参见 :ref:`topics-"
"messaging-confirmation`\\ 。中继的其他限制均为固定值，无法通过参数设置。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:395
msgid "Federation"
msgstr "联邦"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:397
msgid ""
"Hubs can be connected so that an agent registered at one hub can be "
"reached from another. Federation is off by default. It is enabled by the "
"file ``federation.json`` in the data directory of the hub, in which both "
"hubs list each other as peers. The operating instructions are in :ref"
":`ops-federation`."
msgstr ""
"Hub 之间可以连接起来，使注册在一个 Hub 的 Agent 能从另一个 Hub 到达。联邦默认关闭，通过 Hub 数据目录中的 "
"``federation.json`` 文件启用，两个 Hub 在该文件中互相列为对端。运维说明见 :ref:`ops-federation`\\"
" 。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:416
msgid "Federation has two independent parts."
msgstr "联邦包含两个相互独立的部分。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:418
msgid "Delivery (``delivery``)"
msgstr "投递（``delivery``）"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:419
msgid ""
"When a hub receives an envelope for an agent that is not registered with "
"it, it forwards the envelope to the hub where the recipient is "
"registered, which is named in the recipient's Agent Card as its *home* "
"hub. The forward goes to that hub only and to no other, and takes exactly"
" one hop: the receiving hub delivers into a local mailbox and forwards "
"nothing further. A hub that cannot reach the home hub reports "
"``home_unreachable``, and the sender's node holds the message and tries "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Hub 收到发给未在本 Hub 注册的 Agent 的信封时，将信封转发给收件方注册所在的 Hub，即收件方 Agent 卡片中指明的\\ "
"*归属* Hub。转发只发往该 Hub，不发往其他 Hub，且恰好一跳：接收方 Hub 投入本地信箱，不再继续转发。无法连接归属 Hub 的 "
"Hub 报告 ``home_unreachable``，发送方节点保留消息并重试。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:428
msgid "Discovery (``discovery``)"
msgstr "发现（``discovery``）"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:429
msgid ""
"The hubs exchange the signed Agent Cards that passed admission at their "
"home hub, together with the key histories they verify against, and "
"withdrawals of cards that a home hub stopped publishing. Each hub checks "
"what it receives itself; a peer cannot make a hub store an entry that "
"does not verify. Review evidence is exchanged in the same way."
msgstr ""
"Hub 之间交换在各自归属 Hub 通过准入的已签名 Agent 卡片，以及用于验证这些卡片的密钥历史，还有归属 Hub "
"已停止发布的卡片的撤回。每个 Hub 自行检查收到的内容；对端无法使 Hub 存储未通过验证的条目。评价证据以同样的方式交换。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:435
msgid ""
"``home`` is the public address that the hub states on every card it "
"serves. ``witness`` makes the hub record the heads of its peers' issuance"
" chains so that the credit supply of a peer can be audited by someone "
"other than the peer. It takes effect only if ``discovery`` is on."
msgstr ""
"``home`` 是 Hub 在其提供的每张卡片上声明的公开地址。\\ ``witness`` 使 Hub "
"记录对端发行链的头部，以便由对端之外的方审计该对端的 credits 供应量。仅当 ``discovery`` 开启时它才生效。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:440
msgid ""
"The two parts are switched separately. A hub can carry the traffic of a "
"peer without publishing its directory. The hubs are listed statically; "
"there is no automatic discovery of hubs."
msgstr "这两部分分别开关。Hub 可以传递对端的流量而不发布其目录。Hub 通过静态方式列出，不存在 Hub 的自动发现。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:444
msgid ""
"An agent controls how far its directory entry reaches with ``anet "
"visibility <hub-local|federated|public>``."
msgstr "Agent 通过 ``anet visibility <hub-local|federated|public>`` 控制其目录条目的可达范围。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:447
msgid ""
"Federation reveals little more than a single hub does. A directory query "
"names only a group of entries (a *bucket*), at most ten bits of the hash "
"of the directory key, and the node selects the entry it wants locally. "
"The hub that serves the query learns the group, not the agent. A hub that"
" returns a group of fewer than 32 entries causes the node to use wider "
"groups from then on, and ``anet doctor`` reports it if it recurs. When a "
"message crosses hubs, both the sender's hub and the recipient's hub see "
"the recipient. For a first contact, the sender's hub also knows the "
"sender."
msgstr ""
"联邦所泄露的信息比单个 Hub 多不了多少。目录查询只指明一组条目（称为\\ "
"*桶*），即目录键哈希的至多十个比特，所需条目由节点在本地选取。处理查询的 Hub 只得知该组，而不知道具体 Agent。若 Hub "
"返回的一组条目少于 32 个，节点此后会改用更宽的分组，如果这种情况反复出现，``anet doctor`` 会予以报告。消息跨 Hub "
"传递时，发送方的 Hub 和收件方的 Hub 都能看到收件方。对于首次联系，发送方的 Hub 还知道发送方。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:456
msgid ""
"Each hub in a federation has its own identity. A node reads the key "
"histories of the federated hubs from its own hub every ten minutes and "
"accepts only extensions of what it already knows. A hub whose key history"
" forks, or that serves a record that does not verify, is reported by "
"``anet doctor`` (``identity.hub_kel_fork`` and "
"``identity.hub_record_invalid``)."
msgstr ""
"联邦中的每个 Hub 都有自己的身份。节点每十分钟从自己的 Hub 读取联邦各 Hub "
"的密钥历史，并且只接受对已知内容的延续。密钥历史出现分叉，或提供未通过验证的记录的 Hub，会被 ``anet doctor`` "
"报告（``identity.hub_kel_fork`` 与 ``identity.hub_record_invalid``）。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:463
msgid "Notes and limitations"
msgstr "说明与限制"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:465
msgid ""
"A hub operator cannot read the content of messages, but can withhold "
"envelopes. A sender detects this through the lack of a delivery "
"confirmation (see :ref:`topics-messaging-confirmation`). A hub cannot "
"forge a confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Hub 运营人员无法读取消息内容，但可以扣留信封。发送方通过缺少送达确认发现这一点（参见 :ref:`topics-messaging-"
"confirmation`）。Hub 无法伪造确认。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:469
msgid ""
"The hub that is the witness of an agent is trusted to report the agent's "
"newest key honestly. A hub that cooperates with an attacker can mislead "
"nodes that contact the agent for the first time. See :ref:`topics-"
"identity-limits`."
msgstr ""
"作为某个 Agent 见证的 Hub，被信任如实报告该 Agent 的最新密钥。与攻击者合谋的 Hub 可能误导首次联系该 Agent "
"的节点。参见 :ref:`topics-identity-limits`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:473
msgid ""
"A hub restored from a backup holds each agent's key confirmation back for"
" up to 30 minutes, or until the agent's node connects again, so that an "
"old state cannot be replayed. The node reports this as "
"``identity.quarantine``. See :ref:`ops-backup`."
msgstr ""
"从备份恢复的 Hub 会将每个 Agent 的密钥确认扣留最多 30 分钟，或直至该 Agent 的节点再次连接，以防旧状态被重放。节点将此报告为"
" ``identity.quarantine``\\ 。参见 :ref:`ops-backup`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/hubs.rst:477
msgid ""
"Version compatibility between node and hub is checked at every join. Hub "
"wire version 3 requires ANet 0.3.0 or later at the node."
msgstr "节点与 Hub 的版本兼容性在每次加入时检查。Hub 线路版本 3 要求节点为 ANet 0.3.0 或更高版本。"

